cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Slop de Géométrie Algébrique: SGA in English and Lean"
message: "If you use this translation or the Lean development, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SlopdeGeometrieAlgebrique contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/Dharmavati213/SlopdeGeometrieAlgebrique"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dharmavati213/SlopdeGeometrieAlgebrique"
url: "https://github.com/Dharmavati213/SlopdeGeometrieAlgebrique"
abstract: >
  Unofficial English translations of Grothendieck's Séminaire de
  Géométrie Algébrique du Bois Marie (SGA), together with a Lean 4
  formalization on mathlib. SGA 1, SGA 2 and SGA 3 are translated in full;
  SGA 1 is formalized exposé by exposé, and SGA 2 in part (Exposés I–VII).
keywords:
  - SGA
  - Grothendieck
  - algebraic geometry
  - étale fundamental group
  - local cohomology
  - group schemes
  - Lean 4
  - mathlib
license: MIT
